  "body": "Space, style and an enviable Orewa location - this is a home that truly delivers.\r\nBeautifully renovated and thoughtfully configured, this impressive 200sqm home combines modern comfort, generous living spaces and exceptional versatility, all set on a 467sqm freehold corner site with multiple parking, just moments from Orewa Beach and the vibrant town centre.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the quality of the renovation shines through. Character timber floors, light-filled interiors and inviting spaces create a home that feels both stylish and warm, with room for the whole family to spread out and enjoy.\r\nUpstairs is the heart of the home, where spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen areas come together. The beautifully appointed designer kitchen is a standout, featuring a premium seven-burner SMEG gas cooker, generous bench space and excellent storage - perfect for everyday family life and entertaining friends. The living area flows onto a north-facing deck, while three outdoor decks in total offer wonderful options for enjoying the sun throughout the day.\r\nThe upstairs master bedroom is a peaceful retreat, with direct access to the beautifully renovated semi-ensuite bathroom. A dedicated study nook on the landing adds a practical touch for working from home.\r\nDownstairs, the home's flexibility really comes into its own. Three generous double bedrooms, a large family bathroom and a second living area provide excellent separation for growing families, teenagers, extended family or guests. Bifold windows open towards the garden, while separate external access adds another layer of independence.\r\nBeyond the main home, a separate garden studio offers more possibilities. Whether you need a home office, gym, creative space or hobby room, this is a valuable extra. The laundry is located within the garage, which also features an automatic door.\r\nOutside, the fully fenced backyard provides a secure space for children and pets, while the corner position and dual access from West Hoe Road and Centreway Road offer multiple parking options and easy access.\r\nAnd then there's the location. Adjacent to Victor Eaves Park and approximately 400 metres from Orewa's famous three-kilometre stretch of golden sand, this address puts the best of coastal living within easy reach. Enjoy morning beach walks, coffee at your favourite café, dinner in town or a relaxed stroll to supermarkets and everyday amenities. Major bus routes are within easy walking distance, the motorway on-ramp is a short drive away, and the property is in zone for Orewa Beach Primary and Orewa College.\r\nAfter eight wonderful years, our owners are heading south, creating a fantastic opportunity for a new family to make this special property their own.\r\nBeautifully renovated, generously proportioned, and superbly positioned on freehold land, this home offers far more than first impressions - it delivers space, flexibility, and the relaxed coastal lifestyle Orewa is loved for.\r\nCome and experience it for yourself. Contact Sarah today for further information or visit one of our scheduled open homes.\r\nOther agents and conjunctional sales are always welcome.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/LL21",
